GIBBS FREE ENERGY
-------------------

The Gibbs free energy is G = H - T*S

Total enthalpy                    ...   -828.43922295 Eh 
Total entropy correction          ...     -0.05248353 Eh    -32.93 kcal/mol
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Final Gibbs free energy         ...   -828.49170648 Eh

For completeness - the Gibbs free energy minus the electronic energy
G-E(el)                           ...      0.16218593 Eh    101.77 kcal/mol



